Z||000000||Jay||11-02-2001||06:22 PM||||Sunday November 4th is the last shoot out for the year at Cayuga.  I'm going.  Who's with me and where do you want to meet?<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||banditbalz||11-02-2001||07:01 PM||||Becky and I will be there. Let's meet at the Tim Hortons on Hwy 20 (usuall spot)in Hamilton. 8 a.m. sound cool?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackwhite2_3.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||1
