Z||000003||72vinman||11-02-2001||07:47 PM||||9am is good. How do you get to the Tims in Hamilton.||||reg||1
Z||000004||banditbalz||11-02-2001||09:34 PM||||confirmed; Jay (NorthstAR), Lothar ('88 turbo 2.8), Bob (modded sunfire) and myself (stock 2.8 muncie). My wife Becky and her girlfriend Alison will be there to shoot some video. 72 Vinman and Thumper will be there for support. <BR>To get to the Tim's, take QEW Niagara over the skyway bridge in Hamilton. Get off on Confederation Park exit (2nd or 3rd exit after the skyway). Turn right onto Confederation. You go under a small train trestle and Tim's is on the right hand side.<BR>9 a.m. is good. <P>Bring warm clothes as the high for Sunday is gonna be a horsepower walloping 9 deg.<P><BR>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!<p>[This message has been edited by banditbalz (edited 11-02-2001).]||||reg||1
